            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2KI.24.8+2KI.24.9+2KI.24.10+2KI.24.11+2KI.24.12+2KI.24.13+2KI.24.14+2KI.24.15"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Ilai 24.8-15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.36.9+2CH.36.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Int 36.9-10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " “Ore anaa enaishu Olaitoriani ojo, hoo naa ore Konia olayioni le Yehoiakim olaiguanani le Yuda, naa olgisoi omishirakino enkarna ai te nkaina ai e tatene, ore ake eyia, aidim nanu atopolosai ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.22.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.22.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 22:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "naaishooyo iyie apik atua enkaina e lelo ooing'oru enkishui ino, lelo liure iyie naapik atua enkaina e Nebukadresa olaiguanani le Babilon o atua nkaik oo Lkaldayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.22.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.22.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 22:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kaanang'aa nanu iyie o ina ng'utunyi nikitoiwuo iyie anang'aki atua ae kop, ine neitu apa kiinieki, naa teine ilo iyie aye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.22.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.22.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 22:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kake ore ina kop nang'uar ninche pee eshukokino, meshukokino ninche.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.22.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.22.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 22:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amaa ele tung'ani oji Konia kemoti natemenayioki natadanye, entoki nemeshilaa hoo ng'ae? Kainyoo paa ore ninye o nkera enyena netanang'ayioki aaiturraa tiatua enkop nemeyiolo ninche? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.22.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.22.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 22:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iyie na kop, na kop, na kop, toning'o ororei lo Laitoriani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.22.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.22.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 22:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nji ejo Olaitoriani: “Ngero ele tung'ani ajo meeta nkera, ele tung'ani lemedupoyu too nkolong'i enyena; amu meetae hoo obo tiatua eishoi enye odupoyu atonie olorika le nkitoo le Daudi, neitoki aitoreisho te Yuda.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.22.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.22.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
